IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PEN0035.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 IN-RECORD.
    COPY PEN0035C.
01 OUT-RECORD.
    05 WAIVER-IND         PIC X VALUE 'N'.
    05 LATE-FEE           PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAINLINE.
    ACCEPT IN-RECORD
    PERFORM WAIVE-PENALTY
    DISPLAY "WAIVER-IND=" WAIVER-IND
    DISPLAY "LATE-FEE=" LATE-FEE
    STOP RUN.
WAIVE-PENALTY.
    IF FIRST-OFFENSE = 'Y'
        EVALUATE TRUE
            WHEN CUSTOMER-TIER = 'G' OR 'P'
                MOVE 'Y' TO WAIVER-IND
                MOVE 0 TO LATE-FEE
            WHEN DAYS-LATE <= 7
                MOVE 'Y' TO WAIVER-IND
                MOVE 0 TO LATE-FEE
        END-EVALUATE
    END-IF.
